# Large files are stored in Git LFS. Two reasons:
#   - anything over 100 MB cannot be a normal git blob at all
#   - the GitHub Pages artifact has a 1 GB limit, and LFS files are checked out
#     as pointers by the Pages workflow (lfs: false), so they cost it nothing.
# Downloads still work: generate_site.py routes LFS files through
# media.githubusercontent.com rather than the Pages host.
#
# Paths must match exactly - a stale rule silently stops protecting a file.
6thSem/CN/Notes/CN_Part_1.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
6thSem/CN/Notes/CN_Part_2.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
6thSem/CN/Notes/CN_Part_3.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
6thSem/Operational_Reasearch/OR_till_mid_sem.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
6thSem/NLP/Notes/NLP_Part_1.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
